<title>USA: Houston $382 mln bonds repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Houston $382 mln bonds repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it repriced Houston's $381.7 million water and sewer bond deal, lowering yields five basis points in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2027 unchanged at 5.80 percent.</p>
